Subject: build the Flow port on a current nightly

Issue: rust-lang/rust#156749
Upstream: not filed with facebook/flow yet
Submodule: 81b0c2a3dd591c66c51167aac341d851932bd9c5

The compiler removed `box_patterns` around the 2026-09-01 nightly
(rust-lang/rust#156749). `box pat` is `deref!(pat)` under `deref_patterns`.
`never_type` has been stable since Rust 1.100 (rust-lang/rust#155499), so the
feature attribute warns on a current nightly and is removed. Neither change
is a Flow rule. Delete this when facebook/flow builds on a toolchain that
already has both.
